1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,430
To place a trade, right click an instrument in the watchlist.

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:09,240
Choose Market Order Buy.

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:13,600
The order ticket opens. A market order trades at the current price.

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,960
Pick Buy or Sell here.

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:20,820
These are the live prices you will get.

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:25,190
Set how much to trade. This is the smallest size, 0.01 lots.

7
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,550
Trader Range is how many pips the price may slip and still fill.

8
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:33,410
You can add a stop loss or take profit now, or later.

9
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:39,920
Click Buy to place the order.

10
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:44,430
Your new trade appears straight away under Open positions.

